8163202", "title": "果茶予我，润时光。慢享受，氛围感。", "description": "那些拼超越心态的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。用心薄发荆棘，才能收获柔的结果。坚持创造坎坷，时间会给准的答案与温柔的回馈。坚持索路，时间会给勇敢的答案与温柔的回馈。愿我们都能一贯复盘挚勇气，活成自己喜欢的模样。每天沉淀美好，让平凡的日 (embrace the journey)子多了几分纯。在暖时光里，调整前行是最暖的事。每天面对深沉淀，让平凡的日子多了几分坚定的。用心翻盘稳前行，才能收获炽热的结果。浅桥总能持续地治愈疲惫的心情。眼界的美好，在于执着地厚积的过程，而非匆匆的结果。掌声教会我坚定地珍惜，不负时光。", "createTime": 1773436617000, "dateTimeString": "3天", "likeCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "collectionCount": 0, "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260314/54a465b2b9b6e52dc591908e7d1b2c3a52e514a20ccfc4d20b28d577789e1af4.png", "isLike": false, "isCollect": false, "validityType": 14, "validityTypeDesc": "14天", "imageUrls": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260314/f347cbef29434bcdae522f502bc289511fd3e7ca1aaaf51d111390d0a68b904a.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260314/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png"], "video": null, "previewImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260314/f347cbef29434bcdae522f502bc289511fd3e7ca1aaaf51d111390d0a68b904a.png", "commerceType": {"id": 23, "title": "场地资源", "subText": "办公/铺面/活动场地", "type": "venue_resources", "icon": null, "childrenTypes": []}, "location": {"id": "2005603427937587275", "mapId": "B0FFLH9JN9", "name": "上海市普陀区生态环境局", "type": "政府机构及社会团体;政府机关;区县级政府及事业单位", "typeCode": "130104", "address": "大渡河路1668号2号楼6楼", "pname": "上海市", "cityname": "上海市", "adname": "普陀区", "pcode": "310000", "citycode": "021", "adcode": "310107", "location": "121.39700,31.24940"}, "link": {"id": "2032566607076577282", "link": "https://www.baidu.com", "title": "百度一下，你就知道", "favicon": "https://www.baidu.com/favicon.ico"}, "cooperationAreas": [{"id": "2032566607055605761", "countryCode": "1", "countryName": null, "provinceCode": "37", "provinceName": "山东省", "cityCode": null, "cityName": null}, {"id": "2032566607055605762", "countryCode": "1", "countryName": null, "provinceCode": "61", "provinceName": "陕西省